WEBVTT

00:03:59.176 --> 00:04:01.230
So they send people letters, and they say,

00:04:01.254 --> 00:04:03.558
"Please, please, please,
switch to generics.

00:04:03.582 --> 00:04:07.009
You will save money, we will save money,
your employer will save money."

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:08.261
And what do people do?

00:04:08.657 --> 00:04:09.808
Nothing.

00:04:09.832 --> 00:04:12.310
So they try all kinds of things
and nothing happens.

00:04:12.334 --> 00:04:15.426
So for one year, they give people
an amazing offer.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.399
They send people a letter, and they say,

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:21.117
"If you switch to generics now,
it will be free for a whole year."

00:04:21.141 --> 00:04:22.648
Free for a whole year. Amazing!

00:04:23.179 --> 00:04:26.027
What percentage of people
do you think switched?

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:28.466
Less than 10 percent.

00:04:29.104 --> 00:04:31.342
At this point, they show up to my office.